48a244deb95bda92c7a5e.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thank you for sharing that. To proceed, could you confirm which card was used for this charge? That way, we can compare it with the current card on file and determine if it matches.", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\83c02a323cda497bd8b0bf29.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Understood; I checked which card identifier the charge used.", "kind": "causal_rule", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\2a8859e889d4bae7d7005c3f.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thank you for confirming. Can you share the last four digits of the card that was used for the disputed charge? That way, we can verify if it matches the card currently on file.", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\40d0375830b5c86860e4caa8.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "My current card was reissued, but the disputed transaction carried the original card reference.", "kind": "clue", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\2542f34d2f2f9b9b30c34545.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for the update. Now, to confirm, is the mailing address on the profile still correct? This will help us ensure we send any notifications or follow-up details to the right place.", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\7d035f59195b8632de9b51ad.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that address is right.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\93fde1e0e1d1ef8327e01a76.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Understood. Would a paper copy of the outcome be helpful?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\6e80a6fe2941792290467775.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, electronic is fine.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\c3b040e2af511836a193db2a.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. Just to clarify, do you typically use the mobile application to check your account balances, or do you prefer another method?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\ebf5f42bc15cd80425f5f5a0.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, almost every day.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\27cd2139f6d4a79f122d7eb5.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Was the physical card in your possession that day?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\d1bd43415829ec0adef8e5a3.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, it was in my wallet the whole time.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\76cc51106e00d1ac0a8a72e6.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for confirming that. Have you shared the card number with any recurring service? This will help us figure out how the charge might have occurred.", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\56fd95f14e7c6d3bb13927d0.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Only my usual streaming subscription.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\ca48668e4ef62bf69a56e0df.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Thanks for confirming. Could you tell me if the contact number ending in six-one-eight is still yours? This will help us ensure we’re reaching you on the correct line.", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\91e813fa50a95c144ce55e85.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that number is current.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\trajectories\\turns\\3a007fcae1aba4c91673b007.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Understood. Were there other unfamiliar amounts on t